<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_appendix">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A3.SS0.SSS0.Px1" title="In Appendix C Prompt for IMDB Dataset ‣ Does Using Counterfactual Help LLMs Explain Textual Importance in Classification?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Prompts for DP:</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A3.SS0.SSS0.Px2" title="In Appendix C Prompt for IMDB Dataset ‣ Does Using Counterfactual Help LLMs Explain Textual Importance in Classification?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Prompts for CFP:</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A3.SS0.SSS0.Px3" title="In Appendix C Prompt for IMDB Dataset ‣ Does Using Counterfactual Help LLMs Explain Textual Importance in Classification?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Prompts for CFS:</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A3.SS0.SSS0.Px4" title="In Appendix C Prompt for IMDB Dataset ‣ Does Using Counterfactual Help LLMs Explain Textual Importance in Classification?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Prompts for obtaining decision-changing score:</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></nav>
</nav>
